  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n11.5 − [5 + 0.5 × (9 − 3 × 2)]\n\n**Rule used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f8976f8e1c1d3a5aac29f20639884c3715ceed7a4c3a646aaf0b4514394f46af.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n11.5 − [5 + 0.5 × (9 − 3 × 2)] \n\n⇒ 11.5 − [5 + 0.5 × (9 − 6)] \n\n⇒11.5 − [5 + 0.5 × 3] \n\n⇒ 11.5 − [5 + 1.5] \n\n⇒ 11.5 − 6.5 = 5\n\n**∴ The value of 11.5 − [5 + 0.5 × (9 − 3 × 2)] is 5.**",
